    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 18.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þær beo on ðære scire bisceop ⁊ se ealdorman ⁊ þær ægðer tæcan ge Godes riht ge woruldriht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the bishop of the diocese and the ealdorman shall attend, and they shall direct the administration of both ecclesiastical and secular law.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þær beo on þære scire bisceop ⁊ se ealdorman, ⁊ þær ægþer tæcan ge Godes riht ge woruldriht.</ab>
